==Release information==
===Gyarados===
This figure was available as a Reward for clearing Challenge 10 in the {{OBP|Training Center|Duel}} starting in version 5.0.10. It was also available in Gym Boosters during the Round 1 {{DL|Gym Cup|Flying Gym Cup}} held from February 9 to 16, 2017 and as a Duel Wins Reward and in Gym Boosters during the Round 1 {{DL|Gym Cup|Grass Gym Cup}} held from April 19 to 26, 2017. It was also available as a Monthly Points Reward from {{DL|Monthly Point|June 12 to July 3, 2019}}.

===Shiny Gyarados===
This figure was available as a {{DL|Login Bonus (Duel)|Special Login Bonus}} from October 1 to 16, 2018.

