{{DuelGallery/h|water|flying}}
{{DuelGallery|image1=ShinyGyaradosDuel400.png|caption1={{shiny}} Gyarados}}
|}

==Trivia==
*Prior to version 7.0.14, these figures were unable to be purchased in the Material Exchange.

===Origin===
This figured is based on the {{TFG ID|Unnamed Third Set|Gyarados|15}} from the {{TFG|Unnamed Third Set}}. {{m|Hyper Beam}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Gyarados}} can learn. {{m|Hydro Vortex}} and {{m|Supersonic Skystrike}} are [[Z-Move]]s in the games that Gyarados can use by equipping [[Waterium Z]] and [[Flyinium Z]], respectively.

