==Release information==
This figure was available as an Achievement Reward from the {{DL|Queen's Cup|June 14 to 23, 2016}} Queen's Cup. It was also available as an Achievement Reward from the {{DL|Event (Duel)|Pikachu Carnival}} held from August 9 to 23, 2016. It was also available as a Duel Wins Reward and in Gym Boosters during the Round 2 {{DL|Gym Cup|Water Gym Cup}} held from May 2 to 10, 2017 and the Round 5 {{DL|Gym Cup|Water Gym Cup}} held from December 20 to 24, 2018. It was also available as a {{DL|Login Bonus (Duel)|Special Login Bonus}} from November 30 to December 13, 2017 to celebrate the release of version 5.0.0, from August 2 to 14, 2018 to celebrate 36 million downloads, and from July 3 to 23, 2019 to celebrate the release of version 7.0.12.

