==Release information==
This figure was available as a Duel Wins Reward and in Gym Boosters during the Round 2 {{DL|Gym Cup|Fire Gym Cup}} held from May 24 to 28, 2018.

==Trivia==
*Prior to version 7.0.14, this figure was unable to be purchased in the Material Exchange.

===Origin===
