===Magikarp===
This figure was available as a Reward for clearing Challenge 4 in the {{OBP|Training Center|Duel}} starting in version 5.0.10. It was also available in Gym Boosters during the Round 1 {{DL|Gym Cup|Flying Gym Cup}} held from February 9 to 16, 2017 and as a Duel Wins Reward and in Gym Boosters during the Round 1 {{DL|Gym Cup|Grass Gym Cup}} held from April 19 to 26, 2017. It was also available as a Monthly Points Reward from {{DL|Monthly Point|June 12 to July 3, 2019}}.

===Shiny Magikarp===
This figure was available as an Achievement Reward during the {{DL|Team Match|Rowlet, Litten, and Popplio}}, {{DL|Team Match|Scizor, Empoleon, and Lucario}}, and {{DL|Team Match|Zekrom, Kyurem, and Reshiram}} Team Matches held from November 24 to 27, 2017, December 22 to 25, 2017, and April 20 to 23, 2018, respectively. It was also available as a Reward from the {{DL|Dev Showdown|October 9 to 11, 2018}} Dev Showdown.

