This figure was available as a {{DL|Mission (Duel)|Beginner Mission}} Reward. It was also available as a Duel Wins Reward and in Gym Boosters during the Round 2 {{DL|Gym Cup|Fire Gym Cup}}, the Round 4 {{DL|Gym Cup|Water Gym Cup}}, and the Round 3 {{DL|Gym Cup|Fire Gym Cup}} held from May 24 to 28, 2018, July 26 to 30, 2018, and August 17 to 21, 2018 respectively. It was also available as an Achievement Reward during the {{DL|Queen's Cup|April 5 to 10, 2018}} and {{DL|Queen's Cup|August 2 to 7, 2018}} Queen's Cups.

==Trivia==
*Prior to version 7.0.14, this figure was unable to be purchased in the Material Exchange.

===Origin===
This figure features the {{DL|List of Pokémon with form differences|Rotom|normal form}} of {{p|Rotom}}. {{a|Infiltrator}} is an [[Ability]] in the [[Pokémon games]] although Rotom cannot have it. {{m|Discharge}} and {{m|Thunder Wave}} are [[move]]s in the games that Rotom can learn. {{m|Gigavolt Havoc}} and {{m|Never-Ending Nightmare}} are [[Z-Move]]s in the games that Rotom can use by equipping [[Electrium Z]] and [[Ghostium Z]], respectively.

