===Shiny Tapu Koko===
This figure was available for purchase in the Shiny Tapu Koko Set starting on {{DL|Shop (Duel)|Shiny Tapu Koko Set 1|June 13, 2018}} and from {{DL|Shop (Duel)|Shiny Tapu Koko Set 1|December 19 to 26, 2018}}. During these times it was also available via {{DL|Shop (Duel)|Material Exchange}} for 4000 materials.

